  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup butter, softened",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "1 teaspoon paprika",
    "1 teaspoon Italian seasoning",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt-free garlic and herb seasoning blend (such as Mrs. Dash®)",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "1 (3 pound) turkey breast with skin",
    "1 teaspoon minced shallot",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1 splash dry white wine",
    "1 cup chicken stock",
    "3 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons half-and-half"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5fI9xdB6whNBKrnkEFK7elZ_xuo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229658-Oven-Roasted_Turkey_Breast-DDMFS-Step1-11750-b79ea40d4c854c6ea9345187a3f5e2ec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229658/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix 1/4 cup butter, garlic, paprika, Italian seasoning, herb seasoning, salt, and pepper together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cqLpyOVHamQCMtCE5jKLSy-hxoo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229658-Oven-Roasted_Turkey_Breast-DDMFS-Step2-11751-e50af88792af48339169ce337843943f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229658/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place turkey, skin-side up, in a roasting pan. Loosen skin with fingers; spread 1/2 of the butter mixture over turkey and under skin. Reserve remaining butter mixture. Tent turkey loosely with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eavEuLWqfjYFDT1PTn_HGNVwGjM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229658-Oven-Roasted_Turkey_Breast-DDMFS-Step3-11752-f8b855dd6a6147daa1a3d96749ea0d43.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229658/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 1 hour. Baste with remaining butter mixture, return to oven and continue to cook until juices run clear and an instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the breast reads 165 degrees F (74 degrees C), about 30 minutes more. Remove to a cutting board and let rest for 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WJglECra2Z-3QaRQWjrkvLBWVvs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229658-Oven-Roasted_Turkey_Breast-DDMFS-Step4-11759-9b7d4cf6126347cab857cd04e39b70c5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229658/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer about 1 tablespoon of pan drippings to a medium skillet. Add shallot and cook on low until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0KceWVXP_ZhNogWXV2YS7qD9iAY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229658-Oven-Roasted_Turkey_Breast-DDMFS-Step5-11754-332823e389a343759c6bc75011bf2937.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229658/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 1 tablespoon butter to the skillet; whisk in wine, scraping up any browned bits from the bottom of the pan. Whisk in stock and flour until smooth. Bring to a simmer, whisking constantly, until thickened. For a creamier, lighter gravy, whisk in half-and-half.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/S8K_GgwufCYQmxuCPRrWuz_vZII=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229658-Oven-Roasted_Turkey_Breast-DDMFS-Step5-11756-c1e6fd60cc02417ba436f795daa9acef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229658/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice turkey and serve with gravy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uHk4tL_TxKLc9rlsZuuVLx0mEXY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229658-oven-roasted-turkey-breasts-DDMFS-4x3-091a8e4f7c9943dfa1c11d4957ba505b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229658/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
